  "content": "[Verse]\n[E]\n[E]Life is like a\nhurricane\n[A]here [E]in\n[E][A]Duckburg\n[E]Race cars, lasers,\naeroplanes\n[D/A]it's [A]a\n[A][D/A]duckblur!\n[F#m7]Might solve a\n[B7]mystery\n[F#m7]Or rewrite\n[B7]history!\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]DuckTales! Wooo-\no!\n[C]Everyday they're\n[Dsus2]out there making\n[E]DuckTales! Wooo-\no!\n[C]Tales of derring-\n[Dsus2]do, bad and good\n[E]Luck Tales!\n\n[Bridge]\n[A/F#]Ddd danger\n[E/G#]lurks behind you\n[Dsus2]There's a stranger\n[E]out to find you\n[F#/C#]What to do, just\ngrab on to some...\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#]DuckTales! Wooo-\no!\n[D]Everyday they're\n[E]out there making\n[F#]DuckTales! Wooo-\no!\n[D]Tales of derring-\n[E]do, bad and good\n\n[Outro]\n[F#]Luck Tales! Wooo-\no! Not\n[D]pony tales or\n[E]cotton tales, no,\n[F#]DuckTales! Wooo-\no!",
